OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 25 JAN
OL,4,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,5,     GAlyn Shipton has saxophones to
OL,6,     Gthe fore with Bobby Wellins,
OL,7,     GHarry Allen and Serge Chaloff.
OL,8,     GPlus we hear from jazz vocalists
OL,9,     GAnna Pancaldi, Cyrille Aimee and
OL,10,     GPeg LaCentra.
OL,11,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,12,     GHannah French explores a new set
OL,13,     Gof Brandenburg Concertos, based
OL,14,     Gon JS Bach's organ trios, which
OL,15,     Ghave been recently recorded by
OL,16,     GConcerto Copenhagen.
